==Battleground==
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Emilia & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Duches are more a minor annoyance than a threat. Even on {{3c}}, they only deal 2000 damage, meaning they'll be easily stopped. Emilia and Doge are similarly not a threat.

